# 中频词汇 List01
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List01核心词汇

{{abstract}}{/ˈæbstrækt/}{抽象的；摘要}{The paper begins with an abstract summarizing the key findings.}}
{{accelerate}}{/əkˈseləreɪt/}{加速；促进}{The pandemic accelerated the shift to digital services.}}
{{acknowledge}}{/əkˈnɒlɪdʒ/}{承认；致谢}{The author acknowledged the contributions of her colleagues.}}
{{acquire}}{/əˈkwaɪər/}{获得；收购}{The firm acquired three smaller companies last year.}}
{{administration}}{/ədˌmɪnɪˈstreɪʃn/}{管理；行政}{The new administration introduced sweeping reforms.}}
{{adolescent}}{/ˌædəˈlesnt/}{青少年的；青少年}{Adolescent mental health is a growing area of concern.}}
{{advanced}}{/ədˈvɑːnst/}{先进的；高级的}{The lab is equipped with advanced analytical instruments.}}
{{advantage}}{/ədˈvɑːntɪdʒ/}{优势；好处}{One advantage of this method is its simplicity.}}
{{adverse}}{/ˈædvɜːs/}{不利的；有害的}{Adverse conditions made the journey extremely difficult.}}
{{agenda}}{/əˈdʒendə/}{议程；日程}{Diversity is now firmly on the corporate agenda.}}
{{aggressive}}{/əˈɡresɪv/}{侵略性的；积极进取的}{The company pursued an aggressive marketing strategy.}}
{{alert}}{/əˈlɜːt/}{警觉的；警报}{The system issues an alert when levels exceed the threshold.}}
{{alternative}}{/ɔːlˈtɜːnətɪv/}{替代的；可选择的}{Renewable energy offers a clean alternative to fossil fuels.}}
{{ambiguity}}{/ˌæmbɪˈɡjuːəti/}{模棱两可；含糊}{The ambiguity of the law led to different interpretations.}}
{{amend}}{/əˈmend/}{修改；修正}{The constitution was amended to protect individual rights.}}
{{ample}}{/ˈæmpl/}{充足的；丰富的}{There is ample parking available at the venue.}}
{{analogy}}{/əˈnælədʒi/}{类比；类似}{The teacher used an analogy to explain the complex concept.}}
{{annual}}{/ˈænjuəl/}{年度的；每年的}{The annual conference draws thousands of attendees.}}
{{applicable}}{/əˈplɪkəbl/}{适用的；可应用的}{The regulation is applicable to all registered companies.}}
{{appraisal}}{/əˈpreɪzl/}{评价；估价}{The property underwent a thorough appraisal before the sale.}}
{{arrange}}{/əˈreɪndʒ/}{安排；整理}{The organizer arranged the seating by alphabetical order.}}
{{aspect}}{/ˈæspekt/}{方面；外观}{Every aspect of the plan was carefully considered.}}
{{assemble}}{/əˈsembl/}{集合；组装}{The team assembled all the necessary materials.}}
{{assumption}}{/əˈsʌmpʃn/}{假设；假定}{The assumption proved to be incorrect.}}
{{atmosphere}}{/ˈætməsfɪər/}{气氛；大气层}{The café has a cozy and welcoming atmosphere.}}
{{attitude}}{/ˈætɪtjuːd/}{态度；看法}{Her positive attitude helped the team stay motivated.}}
{{attract}}{/əˈtrækt/}{吸引；引起}{The festival attracts visitors from all over the world.}}
{{audit}}{/ˈɔːdɪt/}{审计；审查}{An independent audit was conducted to ensure compliance.}}
{{awareness}}{/əˈweənəs/}{意识；认知}{Public awareness of recycling has improved significantly.}}
{{balance}}{/ˈbæləns/}{平衡；余额}{A balanced diet is essential for good health.}}
